# The built web apps (/public/pos, /delegate, /menu, /admin, /assets, /icons, sw.js, workbox-*.js, *.webmanifest,
# logo.png, favicon.png) ARE kept in git, so the server can be updated straight from GitHub with `git pull` and needs no
# Node.js. After any front-end change, run `npm run build:backend` in the project root and commit backend/public with it.
